DESCRIPTION:Dir. Vittorio De Sica · 97 min\n\nOnce upon a time a wise and 
 kind old woman discovers a baby in her cabbage patch. She brings up the ch
 ild and\, when she dies\, the boy\, Totò\, enters an orphanage. Totò lea
 ves the orphanage a happy young man\, and looks for work in post-war Milan
 . He ends up with the homeless and organizes them to build a shanty town i
 n a vacant lot. But when greedy developers threaten the community’s land
 \, Totò will need all the help he can get in order to find an impossible 
 way out.\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/31187?sit
